{"title": "Notr Na'th", "pageid": 2083, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 278px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/27/Tir-na_Nog%27th.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100806023001\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"An artist depiction of Tir-na Nog&#39;th\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/27/Tir-na_Nog%27th.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/278?cb=20100806023001\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"278\" height=\"238\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Tir-na Nog&#39;th.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tir-na_Nog%27th.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Tir-na_Nog%27th.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">An artist depiction of Notr Na'th</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>\"On the highest ridge of Kolvir there is a formation which resembles three steps...\"\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><b>Notr Na'th</b> is a very special shadow of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a></i> that contains an exact copy of the<i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\">Pattern</a></i>. Notr Na'th only appears on moonlit nights above Kolvir and is connected to Yander by a moonlight stairwell. Notr Na'th is known to interact with the visitor on some level, displaying his or her hidden fears and fantasies.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Tir-na_Nog%27th?acti